## emrac: watch the history ledger (see `emrac ledger watch install`).
## Any write, truncate, rename, delete, chmod or chown of the ledger or its folder:
-w /var/lib/emrac/ -p wa -k emrac-ledger
## Clearing the append-only flag is an ioctl a path watch does not see, but it
## takes chattr, so every run of it is logged:
-w /usr/bin/chattr -p x -k emrac-ledger-attr
